                        <h4>UEi COA2 Offers</h4><p>The wireless carbon monoxide detector has an auto zero upon power on.</p><p><strong>Features</strong></p><ul><li>Free app</li><li>iOS and Android compatible</li><li>CO sensor Self-Test</li><li>Audible alert</li><li>3 Color warning alert</li><li>Max value capture</li><li>Hold</li><li>Back light</li><li>Auto power off</li><li>Belt clip</li><li>1-Year limited warranty</li></ul><p><strong>Applications</strong></p><ul><li>CO detection</li><li>Great for first responders</li></ul>
        
    </div>
    
